1
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:10,720
It's clear in the house rules.

2
00:00:11,119 --> 00:00:14,240
No one enters Ms. Song Huan's room.

3
00:00:14,839 --> 00:00:16,199
What are you doing here?

4
00:00:18,039 --> 00:00:19,039
What's that in your hand?

5
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:20,600
Hand it over.

6
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:22,920
I didn't take anything.

7
00:00:23,199 --> 00:00:24,199
Nothing?

8
00:00:24,519 --> 00:00:25,519
I don't buy it.

9
00:00:25,519 --> 00:00:26,320
Let me search you!

10
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:28,440
Let me search!

11
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:33,280
You pushed me!

12
00:00:33,640 --> 00:00:35,719
I've served this family for years,

13
00:00:35,719 --> 00:00:37,960
and today I caught a thief
right here in the house!

14
00:00:38,520 --> 00:00:39,640
Just you wait!

15
00:00:39,759 --> 00:00:41,159
I'm calling the police!

16
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:44,439
Ms. Chen.

17
00:00:49,680 --> 00:00:54,520
=Dear Song=

18
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:56,920
=Episode 5=
(Theft of the Heart)

19
00:00:57,799 --> 00:00:59,920
I told Yu Song to look for something.

20
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:01,920
If you call the police,

21
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:03,159
are you going to have me arrested?

22
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:06,200
Ms. Song Cheng.

23
00:01:07,079 --> 00:01:08,239
I don't recall

24
00:01:08,239 --> 00:01:09,599
anything in Ms. Song Huan's room

25
00:01:09,879 --> 00:01:11,519
belonging to you.

26
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:28,560
Huan has a silk scarf

27
00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:29,799
I really like.

28
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:32,040
I just noticed her door was open,

29
00:01:32,319 --> 00:01:33,920
so I sent Yu Song in

30
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:35,000
to check the brand.

31
00:01:37,599 --> 00:01:38,040
Right.

32
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:39,799
This is the one.

33
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:42,040
But...

34
00:01:42,599 --> 00:01:43,400
That can't be right.

35
00:01:43,799 --> 00:01:46,599
No one was inside when I shut the door.

36
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:49,200
Maybe you didn't see me

37
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:50,840
when I grabbed the scarf.

38
00:01:54,519 --> 00:01:56,640
If you still don't believe me,

39
00:01:57,799 --> 00:01:58,799
go ahead and search.

40
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:03,480
Ms. Chen.

41
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:06,599
Can we leave now?

42
00:02:28,719 --> 00:02:29,680
Song Cheng.

43
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:31,159
If you like my things,

44
00:02:31,159 --> 00:02:32,479
why not say so?

45
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:41,439
Ms. Song Huan.

46
00:02:41,439 --> 00:02:43,400
Why are you back early?

47
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:50,560
I...

48
00:02:51,199 --> 00:02:52,080
I...

49
00:02:53,919 --> 00:02:56,240
Everything you have is so nice.

50
00:02:56,719 --> 00:02:57,639
I don't dare ask.

51
00:02:58,680 --> 00:03:00,280
Since you were little,

52
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:03,479
you blink when you lie.

53
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:13,000
It's just a scarf.

54
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:17,800
You can have it.

55
00:03:19,439 --> 00:03:20,240
But...

56
00:03:23,240 --> 00:03:24,680
I have rules, too.

57
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:27,319
You should know.

58
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:29,400
Without my permission,

59
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:31,599
no one enters my room.

60
00:03:35,199 --> 00:03:37,039
Whatever punishment you want,

61
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:39,319
I'll accept it all.

62
00:03:40,439 --> 00:03:42,199
Since you like my room,

63
00:03:42,199 --> 00:03:43,080
then stay until you've had enough.

64
00:03:44,080 --> 00:03:46,000
You can't leave this room for 24 hours.

65
00:03:50,400 --> 00:03:52,680
No one disturbs Ms. Song Cheng.

66
00:03:54,719 --> 00:03:56,039
She's frail.

67
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:58,719
She can't handle being locked up.

68
00:03:59,199 --> 00:04:01,120
If you must punish someone,

69
00:04:01,319 --> 00:04:02,240
take me instead.

70
00:04:02,639 --> 00:04:04,120
You're just a personal assistant.

71
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:07,199
I'm handling Song family matters.

72
00:04:10,479 --> 00:04:11,639
Book me a suite.

73
00:04:11,919 --> 00:04:13,800
I'm not coming home tonight.

74
00:04:15,599 --> 00:04:16,399
Yu Song.

75
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:18,000
Why are you standing there?

76
00:04:18,319 --> 00:04:19,519
Go away.

77
00:04:20,680 --> 00:04:21,319
And tomorrow,

78
00:04:21,319 --> 00:04:22,600
don't bother coming in.

79
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:23,839
But don't worry.

80
00:04:24,199 --> 00:04:25,240
You'll still

81
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:26,199
get paid.

82
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:34,040
Relax.

83
00:05:16,199 --> 00:05:17,519
That was a risky move today.

84
00:05:18,199 --> 00:05:19,360
If Ms. Chen had caught you,

85
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,240
you'd be in trouble.

86
00:05:25,279 --> 00:05:26,480
You seem distracted. What's wrong?

87
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:28,600
Oh...

88
00:05:29,199 --> 00:05:30,319
Surprised Song Cheng helped you?

89
00:05:34,399 --> 00:05:35,680
Before I came,

90
00:05:35,879 --> 00:05:38,399
Song Cheng was invisible in the family.

91
00:05:39,639 --> 00:05:41,199
I'm the first to care about her.

92
00:05:41,720 --> 00:05:44,720
And I helped her win
Song Huaishan's attention.

93
00:05:44,920 --> 00:05:45,920
She knows very well

94
00:05:46,199 --> 00:05:48,120
if they found out it was me,

95
00:05:48,399 --> 00:05:49,639
I'd be fired on the spot.

96
00:05:50,319 --> 00:05:51,199
She can't bear to lose me.

97
00:05:56,279 --> 00:05:57,240
But don't you think

98
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:59,199
using her like this

99
00:05:59,199 --> 00:06:00,399
is a little cruel?

100
00:06:02,199 --> 00:06:03,600
She needs me.

101
00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:05,600
And I need her.

102
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,040
Fair trade.

103
00:06:24,120 --> 00:06:24,839
Jing.

104
00:06:25,279 --> 00:06:27,240
If you can't accept me like this,

105
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:29,600
you can walk away.

106
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:36,279
Song.

107
00:06:36,879 --> 00:06:37,920
Whatever you do,

108
00:06:38,439 --> 00:06:39,399
I'm with you.

109
00:07:20,240 --> 00:07:23,000
♪The crescent moon♪

110
00:07:23,319 --> 00:07:25,600
♪The birds all sing♪

111
00:07:26,519 --> 00:07:30,399
♪Papa sails out to fish♪

112
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:33,839
♪The fish are plump♪

113
00:07:34,480 --> 00:07:37,160
♪The fish are lovely♪

114
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:42,319
♪Just pray Papa comes home safe♪

115
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:44,480
Yu Song, look!

116
00:07:44,959 --> 00:07:46,639
The way Dad fishes,

117
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:48,439
he looks like a real fisherman.

118
00:07:51,480 --> 00:07:53,480
Real fishermen don't have it so easy.

119
00:07:54,399 --> 00:07:56,079
Will they catch nothing

120
00:07:56,079 --> 00:07:57,800
or bring home a haul?

121
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:00,600
It's all up to Mother Nature.

122
00:08:05,319 --> 00:08:07,879
♪The crescent moon♪

123
00:08:07,879 --> 00:08:10,160
♪The birds all sing♪

124
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:13,279
♪Papa sails out to fish♪

125
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:16,120
♪The fish are plump♪

126
00:08:16,279 --> 00:08:18,279
♪The fish are lovely♪

127
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:21,600
♪Nothing beats Papa coming home safe♪

128
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:23,920
What a lovely song.

129
00:08:24,199 --> 00:08:25,519
Is it from your hometown?

130
00:08:26,639 --> 00:08:27,360
It's a song

131
00:08:27,360 --> 00:08:29,199
daughters sing while
waiting for their dads

132
00:08:29,199 --> 00:08:30,120
to come home safe.

133
00:08:31,120 --> 00:08:32,799
Especially on dark nights,

134
00:08:33,519 --> 00:08:34,559
singing the song

135
00:08:34,559 --> 00:08:36,080
keeps you warm

136
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:38,080
and the fear goes away.

137
00:08:38,759 --> 00:08:40,200
♪The crescent moon♪

138
00:08:40,200 --> 00:08:42,360
♪The birds all sing♪

139
00:08:42,360 --> 00:08:45,279
♪Papa sails out to fish♪

140
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:51,880
♪Soft winds, gentle waves♪

141
00:08:52,160 --> 00:08:56,720
♪Mama waits by the door till dawn♪

142
00:09:05,639 --> 00:09:07,720
♪The fish are plump♪

143
00:09:07,879 --> 00:09:09,879
♪The fish are lovely♪

144
00:09:10,200 --> 00:09:13,879
♪Nothing beats Papa coming home safe♪

145
00:09:14,639 --> 00:09:16,720
♪The boat rocks gently♪

146
00:09:16,879 --> 00:09:18,879
♪The sails cast shadows♪

147
00:09:19,200 --> 00:09:21,879
♪Smoke curls as we await his return♪

148
00:09:21,879 --> 00:09:23,879
(No one can stop my plan.)

149
00:09:24,399 --> 00:09:26,039
(After all, the Song family)

150
00:09:26,039 --> 00:09:27,159
(owes us.)

151
00:09:48,799 --> 00:09:49,720
Ms. Song Cheng.

152
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:51,320
You can come out now.

153
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:01,200
Let me pick you up.

154
00:10:15,080 --> 00:10:16,320
Good, no fever.

155
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:28,520
♪Our eyes met amid the chaos♪

156
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:31,559
Were you on the floor all night?

157
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:34,039
I'm fine.

158
00:10:34,279 --> 00:10:36,919
Sitting in a wheelchair for so long
gets uncomfortable.

159
00:10:39,160 --> 00:10:43,280
♪Will love break when it ends♪

160
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:46,080
Let's get you back for a hot shower.

161
00:10:46,080 --> 00:10:47,720
I'll make you some soup.

162
00:10:47,720 --> 00:10:48,559
Okay?

163
00:10:48,920 --> 00:10:53,400
♪Who will play the heartless one♪

164
00:10:53,920 --> 00:10:58,800
♪The one who leaves
isn't the one to pity♪

165
00:10:59,200 --> 00:11:03,520
♪The one left behind
sews their tears inside♪

166
00:11:03,880 --> 00:11:07,639
♪Love and hate share a seam♪

167
00:11:07,639 --> 00:11:08,799
Ms. Song Cheng.

168
00:11:08,799 --> 00:11:11,000
Did spending the night in there
teach you a lesson?

169
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:13,600
Don't forget the house rules.

170
00:11:26,720 --> 00:11:27,639
Ms. Chen.

171
00:11:28,679 --> 00:11:31,279
You and I are both nobodies
in this family.

172
00:11:31,879 --> 00:11:33,360
House Rule Number Five:

173
00:11:33,360 --> 00:11:35,039
No disrespect or talking back.

174
00:11:35,399 --> 00:11:36,879
You may have forgotten.

175
00:11:36,919 --> 00:11:38,000
Just a reminder.

176
00:11:56,120 --> 00:11:58,840
Song Huan is more cautious
than I expected.

177
00:11:58,840 --> 00:11:59,679
At home,

178
00:11:59,679 --> 00:12:02,039
she never mentions the project.

179
00:12:02,840 --> 00:12:04,200
Before she notices,

180
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:06,200
get the bug back and destroy it.

181
00:12:08,799 --> 00:12:10,399
Then our deal is over.

182
00:12:11,600 --> 00:12:12,399
Ms. Yu.

183
00:12:13,440 --> 00:12:15,000
You took the job,

184
00:12:15,200 --> 00:12:16,600
so see it through.

185
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:18,000
I want you

186
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:19,679
to get close to Song Huan

187
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:22,480
and get her latest hot spring proposal.

188
00:12:24,240 --> 00:12:26,279
What makes you think I'd help you?

189
00:12:28,639 --> 00:12:29,440
How about this?

190
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:30,840
After it's done,

191
00:12:30,840 --> 00:12:32,440
you get ten percent.

192
00:12:37,919 --> 00:12:38,720
(I found it.)

193
00:12:38,720 --> 00:12:40,280
(No obligation to inform)

194
00:12:41,279 --> 00:12:42,080
Ms. Yu.

195
00:12:42,679 --> 00:12:44,480
I'll give you three days.

196
00:12:44,799 --> 00:12:45,879
But I believe

197
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:47,919
mutual destruction

198
00:12:48,159 --> 00:12:50,399
isn't what a smart person would do.

199
00:12:50,799 --> 00:12:51,639
No need to think.

200
00:12:54,600 --> 00:12:55,399
I'm in.

201
00:12:58,120 --> 00:13:00,799
You're more interesting than Song Lin.

202
00:13:07,639 --> 00:13:08,679
Your foot's healed.

203
00:13:09,080 --> 00:13:10,240
Want your hand reattached next?

204
00:13:25,039 --> 00:13:28,120
Who knew Zhao Hui was a male model

205
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:29,720
before he latched onto Song Lin?

206
00:13:29,919 --> 00:13:31,720
And not just any model.

207
00:13:32,639 --> 00:13:35,320
He was a top draw at the nightclubs.

208
00:13:37,240 --> 00:13:38,200
Jing.

209
00:13:38,519 --> 00:13:40,919
(Pampered, Admiration, Personality)
Even the Songs couldn't dig this up.

210
00:13:40,919 --> 00:13:42,200
How did you find all this?

211
00:13:42,240 --> 00:13:44,399
They investigate from the top down.

212
00:13:45,120 --> 00:13:46,639
But secrets in the shadows...

213
00:13:49,279 --> 00:13:50,440
I've got some skills.

214
00:13:51,600 --> 00:13:53,200
My man is so smart.

215
00:14:00,600 --> 00:14:01,399
What's next?

216
00:14:01,799 --> 00:14:03,679
Are we telling Song Lin
and Song Huaishan?

217
00:14:03,799 --> 00:14:04,679
Of course not.

218
00:14:05,399 --> 00:14:06,519
Whose secret is this?

219
00:14:06,519 --> 00:14:08,519
Who should we use it against?

220
00:14:20,440 --> 00:14:21,240
Yu Song.

221
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:23,279
Where did you get these photos?

222
00:14:23,480 --> 00:14:24,679
What do you want?

223
00:14:24,799 --> 00:14:25,600
Mr. Zhao.

224
00:14:26,320 --> 00:14:27,679
The game's changed.

225
00:14:28,399 --> 00:14:31,000
You have one night to decide.

226
00:14:31,480 --> 00:14:32,200
Either...

227
00:14:32,200 --> 00:14:35,399
These photos will make headlines
across major news outlets tomorrow,

228
00:14:35,639 --> 00:14:37,480
or after I get the proposal,

229
00:14:37,480 --> 00:14:38,919
we'll renegotiate the profit split.

230
00:14:40,480 --> 00:14:41,639
How do you want to split?

231
00:14:45,240 --> 00:14:46,000
You get ten.

232
00:14:46,919 --> 00:14:47,679
I get ninety.
